<title>KAZAKHSTAN: KAZAKH TENGE RISES TO 75.7300 TO DLR.</title>
<headline>KAZAKH TENGE RISES TO 75.7300 TO DLR.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7300 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.7990 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Aug 14		  Aug 13</p>
<p> High			     75.7505		 75.7998</p>
<p> Low				75.7000		 75.6200</p>
<p> Open			     75.7505		 75.6200</p>
<p> Close			    75.7300		 75.7990</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  4.185		   2.750</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509 410</p>
</text>
